-4\">Encyclopaedia Britannica's editors oversee subject areas in which they have extensive knowledge, whether from years of experience gained by working on that content or via study for an advanced degree. They write new content and verify and edit content received from contributors.</div><div data-popper-arrow=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"caption mt-5 d-flex\" data-testid=\"ContentDateAndHistory\"></div></div><div class=\"TableOfContents-module-scss-module__rfopjG__TableOfContents d-none\" data-testid=\"TableOfContents\"><ul class=\"TableOfContents-module-scss-module__rfopjG__TableOfContentsList p-0 mt-0 mb-0 list-unstyled pl-5\" style=\"--category-color:var(--orange-light)\"></ul><div class=\"font-14 font-weight-bold mt-20\">Read More</div><div class=\"TableOfContents-module-scss-module__rfopjG__RelatedArticle\" data-testid=\"RelatedContents\"><a href=\"/money/rand-South-African-currency\" class=\"link-black\" data-testid=\"RelatedContent-1069048\"><div class=\"card card-sm card-horizontal my-15\" data-testid=\"Card\"><div class=\"card-media\" data-testid=\"CardMedia\" style=\"aspect-ratio:50/40\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.britannica.com/15/82315-050-948A3CE7/South-African-banknote.jpg?c=crop&amp;h=40&amp;w=50\" alt=\"South African 200-rand banknote (front side).\" data-testid=\"IrisImage\"/></div><div class=\"card-body\" data-testid=\"CardBody\"><div class=\"font-14\">rand</div></div></div></a><a href=\"/money/money\" class=\"link-black\" data-testid=\"RelatedContent-389170\"><div class=\"card card-sm card-horizontal my-15\" data-testid=\"Card\"><div class=\"card-media\" data-testid=\"CardMedia\" style=\"aspect-ratio:50/40\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.britannica.com/77/73177-004-7FBD08CD/denominations-euro-currency.jpg?c=crop&amp;h=40&amp;w=50\" alt=\"euro denominations\" data-testid=\"IrisImage\"/></div><div class=\"card-body\" data-testid=\"CardBody\"><div class=\"font-14\">money</div></div></div></a><a href=\"/money/coin\" class