 \\u0026 Margin Trading\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"IMAGE\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.britannica.com/21/235621-159-24129B3B/britannica-money-default-subject-logo-retirement.jpg\\\",\\\"width\\\":null},\\\"newTab\\\":false,\\\"noFollow\\\":false,\\\"url\\\":\\\"/money/browse/Futures-Margin-Trading\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":13403,\\\"topCategoryId\\\":13400,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Options Trading\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Options are derivative contracts that give the buyer the right to buy or sell a security at a specific price. Options can be flexible and capital efficient. But understanding the math behind them, plus the lingo, strategies, and risk parameters, requires some training.\\\",\\\"categoryIcon\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"MdOutlineToll\\\",\\\"color\\\":\\\"violet-strong\\\"},\\\"slug\\\":\\\"Options-Trading\\\",\\\"image\\\":{\\\"altText\\\":\\\"Options Trading\\\",\\\"caption\\\":null,\\\"credit\\\":null,\\\"description\\\":\\\"PHOTO\\\",\\\"height\\\":null,\\\"id\\\":null,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Options Trading\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"IMAGE\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.britannica.com/21/235621-159-24129B3B/britannica-money-default-subject-logo-retirement.jpg\\\",\\\"width\\\":null},\\\"newTab\\\":false,\\\"noFollow\\\":false,\\\"url\\\":\\\"/money/browse/Options-Trading\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":13404,\\\"topCategoryId\\\":13400,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Technical Analysis\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Is there predictive power in price and volume data? Technical analysts watch the charts, look for patterns, and use a blend of art and science to try to optimize the timing and price levels for buy and sell orders.\\\",\\\"categoryIcon\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"MdOutlineToll\\\",\\\"color\\\":\\\"violet-strong\\\"},\\\"slug\\\":\\\"Technical-Analysis\\\",\\\"image\\\":{\\\"altText\\\":\\\"Technical Analysis\\\",\\\"caption\\\":null,\\\"credit\\\":null,\\\"description\\\":\\\"PHOTO\\\",\\\"height\\\":null,\\\"id\\\":null,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Technical Analysis\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"IMAGE\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"h