Id\\\":13200,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Pensions \\u0026 Annuities\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"An annuity is a series of payments made at fixed, regular intervals. Defined benefit plans (such as government and company pension plans) are one type of annuity. Insurance companies also sell annuity products that are designed to offer predictable income streams in retirement. But fair warning: they're complex.\\\",\\\"categoryIcon\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"MdSavings\\\",\\\"color\\\":\\\"green\\\"},\\\"slug\\\":\\\"Pensions-Annuities\\\",\\\"image\\\":{\\\"altText\\\":\\\"Pensions \\u0026 Annuities\\\",\\\"caption\\\":null,\\\"credit\\\":null,\\\"description\\\":\\\"PHOTO\\\",\\\"height\\\":null,\\\"id\\\":null,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Pensions \\u0026 Annuities\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"IMAGE\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.britannica.com/21/235621-159-24129B3B/britannica-money-default-subject-logo-retirement.jpg\\\",\\\"width\\\":null},\\\"newTab\\\":false,\\\"noFollow\\\":false,\\\"url\\\":\\\"/money/browse/Pensions-Annuities\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":13204,\\\"topCategoryId\\\":13200,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Retirement Living\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Throughout your career, you've been looking forward to retirement. But once you're there, you have a brand new set of decisions to make: travel, budgeting, tackling the bucket list, and maybe even taking on a new job or side hustle. Retirement living: It's a new beginning.\\\",\\\"categoryIcon\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"MdSavings\\\",\\\"color\\\":\\\"green\\\"},\\\"slug\\\":\\\"Retirement-Living\\\",\\\"image\\\":{\\\"altText\\\":\\\"Retirement Living\\\",\\\"caption\\\":null,\\\"credit\\\":null,\\\"description\\\":\\\"PHOTO\\\",\\\"height\\\":null,\\\"id\\\":null,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Retirement Living\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"IMAGE\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.britannica.com/21/235621-159-24129B3B/britannica-money-default-subject-logo-retirement.jpg\\\",\\\"width\\\":null},\\\"newTab\\\":false,\\\"noFollow\\\":false,\\\"url\\\":\\\"/money/browse/Retirement-Living\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":13205,\\\"topCategoryId\\\":13200,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Retirement Planning\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Are you expecting a long and comfortable retirement? Plan ahead. Will your savings and income streams support all your dreams for your golden years? And do you have contingency plans in case things change? Learn how to plan and strategize for retirement.\\\",\\\"categoryIcon\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"MdSavings\\\",\\\"color\\\":\\\"green\\\"},\\\"slug\\\":\\\"Retirement-Planning\\\",\\\"image\\\":{\\\"altText\\\":\\\"Retirement Planning\\\",\\\"caption\\\":null,\\\"credit\\\":null,\\\"description\\\":\\\"PHOTO\\\",\\\"height\\\":null,\\\"id\\\":null,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Retirement Planning\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"IMAGE\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.britannica.com/21/235621-159-24129B3B/britannica-money-default-subject-logo-retirement.jpg\\\",\\\"width\\\":null},\\\"newTab\\\":false,\\\"noFollow\\\":false,\\\"url\\\":\\\"/money/browse/Retirement-Planning\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":13206,\\\"topCategoryId\\\":13200,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Social Security \\u0026 Medicare\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Most of us pay into Social Security and Medicare throughout our working lives; in retirement, we receive benefits. But to get the most out of these two government programs—and tailor them to your personal situation—you need to learn how they work.\\\",\\\"categoryIcon\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"MdSavings\\\",\\\"color\\\":\\\"green\\\"},\\\"slug\\\":\\\"Social-Security-Medicare\\\",\\\"image\\\":{\\\"altText\\\":\\\"Social Security \\u0026 Medicare\\\",\\\"caption\\\":null,\\\"credit\\\":null,\\\"description\\\":\\\"PHOTO\\\",\\\"height\\\":null,\\\"id\\\":null,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Social Security \\u0026 Medicare\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"IMAGE\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.britannica.com/21/235621-159-24129B3B/britannica-money-default-subject-logo-retirement.jpg\\\",\\\"width\\\":null},\\\"newTab\\\":false,\\\"noFollow\\\":false,\\\"url\\\":\\\"/money/browse/Social-Security-Medicare\\\"}]},{\